# Build output.
#
# These MUST stay anchored. Unanchored `dorang` matches the *directory*
# cmd/dorang/ as well as the binary, which silently untracked the entire cmd/
# tree — the gateway's own entry point was never in version control and a fresh
# clone did not build, while `git status` reported clean.
/bin/
/dist/
/dorang
/dorangctl
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Local dev
.env
*.local.yaml
/data/
/tmp/

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Agent scratch
.claude/
.jikji/

# Local-only working notes (deployment specifics, not for publication)
docs/internal/

# Runtime credential files must never enter source control or image layers.
**/secrets/

# Release cleanup: internal review/research/experiment docs live on locally but
# are not published to the remote (kept out of releases; still on disk).
docs/REVIEW.md
docs/REVIEW.ko.md
docs/SECURITY-REVIEW.md
docs/SECURITY-REVIEW.ko.md
docs/SGLANG.md
docs/SGLANG.ko.md
docs/VLLM.md
docs/VLLM.ko.md
docs/PERFORMANCE.md
testing/parity/REPORT.md
testing/providers/REPORT.md
